#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:5
msgid "Folder properties"
msgstr "文件夹属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:7
msgid ""
"A QElectroTech folder and category are the same. The properties from a "
"folder are:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 中的文件夹与类别是同一概念。文件夹的属性包括："

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:9
msgid "Number of elements in the folder."
msgstr "文件夹中元件的数量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:10
msgid "Number of sub-folders (sub-categories) in the folder."
msgstr "文件夹中子文件夹（子类别）的数量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:11
msgid "Internal QElectroTech collection path from the folder."
msgstr "文件夹在 QElectroTech 集合中的内部路径。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:12
msgid "File system path from the folder."
msgstr "文件夹的文件系统路径。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:14
msgid "Working with collections can only be done from `collections panel`_."
msgstr "集合的相关操作只能在 `集合面板 <collections panel_>`_ 中进行。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:18
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"`collections panel`_."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 集合** 菜单项以显示 `集合面板 <collections panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:20
msgid ""
"Right click on the category (folder) from the collection whose properties "
"should be displayed."
msgstr "右键单击集合中要显示其属性的类别（文件夹）。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:25
msgid "Figure: Options at folder"
msgstr "图：文件夹上的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:27
msgid ""
"Click the option **Folder properties** to display the PopUp window which "
"shows the folder properties."
msgstr "单击 **文件夹属性** 选项，显示文件夹属性的弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/properties_folder.rst:32
msgid "Figure: Folder properties PopUp window"
msgstr "图：文件夹属性弹出窗口"
